1200 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: What's the matter, David? You literally jumped out of the bed...\Did you have another nightmare?":GOSUB 5100
1210 BM$="David thought his conversation with King Hroth had lasted only a few\minutes, but looking outside the windows he noticed it was night.":GOSUB 5100
1220 BM$="Susanna: You fell asleep while I was cooking. What did you dream about this\time?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1230 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I was scolded by King Hroth, and now I see everything clearly. I feel\that by fighting against my fate, I'd only end up hurting you. If I'm destined\to kill, then so be it.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1240 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Are you sure you won't regret it?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1250 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I won't. The moment I accepted my destiny, I started feeling the same\way I felt during a concert. Strong. Confident.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
