1600 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Jeffs: How are you alive? I'm sure the dagger pierced your heart...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1610 GOSUB 6305:BM$="David: So YOU were behind that nightmare... Susanna, he's a sorcerer. In\fact, I think his sorcery is second only to the King of the North himself.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1620 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Jeffs: Indeed, I am a northern sorcerer. The fact you survived my incubus\curse can only mean you manifested the power of the Devil King. If only I\had confirmed you carried his blood earlier...":GOSUB 5100
1630 BM$="Jeffs: No matter. The King of the North will succeed where I've failed. Now\tell me Susanna, why have you brought me here?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1640 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: We want you to tell us the King of the North's whereabouts. We\already know you're not going to tell us willingly, so we're going to cast a\confession spell.":GOSUB 5100
1650 BM$="Susanna: Besides, your spells are too dangerous. We're going to make sure\you can never cast them again.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1660 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Jeffs: Your spells may have been effective on a pair of detectives, but I\am a northern sorcerer. Do you really believe you will succeed?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1670 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: You may be a northern sorcerer, but we are the dark sorcerers\who have been guarding the bloodline of the Devil King for generations.\We will NOT fail.":GOSUB 5100
1680 BM$="Susanna: Take the pills, David. We'll handle the rest.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1690 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I don't need them anymore, Susanna. I'm confident that I can bring\out the power of the Devil King just by listening to your incantation.\The moment I stopped fearing the sight of blood, I've started feeling the":GOSUB 5100:BM$="power of the Devil King more and more.":GOSUB 5100
1700 GOSUB 9050:GOSUB 6120:GOSUB 9535:BM$="Sensing his overwhelming energy, Susanna dropped the pills and began\chanting her spell.":GOSUB 5100
1705 BM$="Jeffs stared at Susanna, and then scoffed at her.":GOSUB 5100
1710 BM$="Jeffs: What a fool you are, Susanna. You have failed to notice the change\within my consciousness... As I thought, you dark sorcerers are nothing but\buffoons.":GOSUB 5100
1720 BM$="David's body was heating up from Susanna's spell; at the same time, he saw\the heat engulfing Jeffs.":GOSUB 5100
1730 BM$="Susanna ignored Jeffs's taunts and kept chanting.":GOSUB 5100
1740 GOSUB 6190:BM$="Jeffs: Even by borrowing David's power, your sorcery amounts to nothing!\You will never be able to control my consciousness!":GOSUB 5100
1750 BM$="Her forehead was beaded with sweat. She was starting to lose her nerve\from her spell's lack of effect.":GOSUB 5100
1755 GOSUB 9020:'
1760 BM$="Jeffs: I've had enough. Have a taste of a REAL spell!":GOSUB 5100
1770 GOSUB 9070:GOSUB 9515:GOSUB 6130:BM$="Jeffs chanted a spell, and Susanna's face turned red, as if she had walked\into an oven.":GOSUB 5100
1780 GOSUB 9555:BM$="Unable to withstand the pain, Susanna stopped chanting. Gasping for air,\she glared at Jeffs.":GOSUB 5100
1790 BM$="Susanna: Only the King of the North can repel a dark spell... I'm afraid the\King of the North is possessing him...":GOSUB 5100
1800 BM$="Jeffs: You've finally realized it. Now, let us put an end to this charade!":GOSUB 5100
1810 GOSUB 6140:BM$="Susanna: EEEK!!":GOSUB 5100
1820 BM$="Blood gushed out of Susanna's face, then from her hands, her feet... She\collapsed to the floor.":GOSUB 5100
1830 BM$="The other dark sorcerers started fleeing in panic, but the spell of the\King of the North spared no one. In a matter of seconds, they were all lying\on the floor, writhing in a pool of their own blood.":GOSUB 5100
1840 GOSUB 9050:GOSUB 6150:BM$="Crying in anger, David jumped at Jeffs, choking him. With his hands tied\behind his back, he could not resist.":GOSUB 5100
1850 BM$="His consciousness filled with rage, David was seemingly impervious to the\King of the North's death curse. His fingers gouged Jeffs's throat.":GOSUB 5100
1860 BM$="Jeffs slumped down to the floor. Unable to speak, his life was leaving his\body.":GOSUB 5100
1870 GOSUB 6160:BM$="David stared at Jeffs's blood. Then, he pointed his bloodied hand south,\chanting - no, howling a spell.":GOSUB 5100
1880 GOSUB 9070:BM$="David, now the Devil King, could easily sense the flow of the spell of the\King of the North. His counterspell, fueled by vengeance, followed the\magical waves back to the source.":GOSUB 5100
1890 GOSUB 6200:BM$="He chanted his spell with all of his might. His figure overlapped with that\of King Hroth, a demon obsessed with vengeance.":GOSUB 5100
